  "description": "Hashira Senju is a bold and expressive display font inspired by traditional Japanese calligraphy and modern street food culture. Its sharp strokes, dynamic forms, and handcrafted feel bring a strong oriental character that instantly captures attention and delivers an authentic Japanese atmosphere. This font creates a powerful visual impact while maintaining readability for headlines and branding purposes.\nDesigned in a single Regular style, Hashira Senju is perfect for ramen shops, sushi brands, street food packaging, restaurant signage, festival posters, menu designs, and Asian-themed branding. Whether you are building a bold food identity or creating eye-catching promotional visuals, Hashira Senju adds cultural depth, energy, and distinctive flavor to your typography.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Hashira Senju is a bold and expressive display font inspired by traditional Japanese calligraphy and modern street food culture. Its sharp strokes, dynamic forms, and handcrafted feel bring a strong oriental character that instantly captures attention and delivers an authentic Japanese atmosphere. This font creates a powerful visual impact while maintaining readability for headlines and branding purposes.</p>\n<p>Designed in a single Regular style, Hashira Senju is perfect for ramen shops, sushi brands, street food packaging, restaurant signage, festival posters, menu designs, and Asian-themed branding. Whether you are building a bold food identity or creating eye-catching promotional visuals, Hashira Senju adds cultural depth, energy, and distinctive flavor to your typography.</p>",
